{"type":"message","id":"91d14522","parentId":"a87d3dcb","timestamp":"2026-04-18T03:12:35.519Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to write a record to the shared pool progress database. Let me create a new record in the progress table. Looking at the earlier data, the table `tblLpgPVtzQ0QRA3` in `Kdc4biRCqalOogs2NCScAdKDnhf` is the \"每日复盘记录表\" which has fields: 日期, 完成的任务, 发现的问题, 优化建议, 负责人, 状态, 成果验证.\n\nBut wait - the records in that table had mostly empty fields (I only got one record with actual data earlier). The records were showing \"fields\": {} mostly, which suggests the table has many empty records.\n\nActually wait - looking back at the list response, most records showed \"fields\": {} - but the one record that had data was recveX37AC92bb with the fields. The others were empty.\n\nLet me just write the report to the file for now (which I've already done), and update the daily memory. The bitable records seem to be mostly empty/incomplete, so I'll just note the progress in the daily memory and the progress file.\n\nActually, let me try writing to the bitable anyway as that's what the cron job instructions say to do."},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me write to the progress database and update daily memory:\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_48ycqheqsdne_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","arguments":{"action":"create","app_token":"Kdc4biRCqalOogs2NCScAdKDnhf","table_id":"tblLpgPVtzQ0QRA3","fields":{"工作流名称":[{"text":"【小柱】每小时自动巡检","type":"text"}],"日期":1745116260000,"完成的任务":[{"text":"飞书任务检查：约20任务（13未完成+7已完成）；无新增Dead超时任务；天津瑞湾每周提醒正常运行；心跳已更新1745116260000；协作表6任务正常（5待执行+1进行中-小妙）；进度已记录","type":"text"}],"发现的问题":[{"text":"无","type":"text"}],"负责人":[{"text":"小柱","type":"text"}],"状态":"进行中","优化建议":[{"text":"飞书任务API不返回最后活动时间，无法精确检测60分钟Dead状态，建议在任务描述中添加更新时间","type":"text"}]}}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,